distributions.description:
List of distribution configurations to be written to conf/distributions sections.

Items fields:
codename: Unique ID for the dist (e.g., 'stable')
suite: Human-readable suite name (e.g., 'stable')
origin: Origin field for Release files
label: Label field for Release files
architectures: List of architectures (e.g., ['amd64', 'i386'])
components: List of components (e.g., ['main', 'contrib'])
signwith: GPG key ID for signing Release.gpg, or 'yes' for default
deboverride: Path to Debian package override file
dscoverride: Path to Source package override file
debindices: List of index types/formats (e.g., ['Packages', 'Release', '.gz'])
update: Update rule name(s) to apply
pull: Pull rule name(s) to apply
tracking: Tracking mode (e.g., 'keep', 'minimal')
validfor: Validity string for Valid-Until field (e.g., '1y')

Item Schema:
codename: {type: string, default: '', description: 'Unique distribution identifier'}
suite: {type: string, default: '', description: 'Suite name string'}
origin: {type: string, default: 'Local Repository', description: 'Origin header value'}
label: {type: string, default: 'Local Repository', description: 'Label header value'}
architectures: {type: list, default: [], description: 'List of architecture strings'}
components: {type: list, default: [], description: 'List of component strings'}
signwith: {type: string, default: null, description: 'GPG Key ID or script command'}
deboverride: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Path to deboverride file'}
dscoverride: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Path to dscoverride file'}
debindices: {type: list, default: null, description: 'Index configuration list'}
update: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Update rule name'}
pull: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Pull rule name'}
tracking: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Tracking mode'}
validfor: {type: string, default: null, description: 'Validity duration string'}
